TYPE	news
DATE	2026-11-26
TITLE	Hot inflation seals a Fed hike as US tariff plan hits Thailand	เงินเฟ้อร้อนแรงตอกย้ำเฟดขึ้นดอกเบี้ย ขณะแผนภาษีสหรัฐฯ พุ่งเป้าไทย
NOTE	US figures are Wednesday Nov 25 closes; US markets are shut Thursday for Thanksgiving. SET and baht are Nov 25. Gold, Brent, iron ore and crypto are latest available quotes.
M	S&P 500	7,182.78	−0.25%	
M	Nasdaq	23,585.80	−0.62%	
M	SET	1,428.50	−1.59%	
M	USD/THB	34.07	+0.34%	Baht weaker, past 34
M	Gold	$3,577	+0.6%	Spot, 4:35pm ET; near 15-month low
M	Brent	$92.4	+1.1%	Quotes vary by source
M	US 10Y	4.85%	−6 bp	
M	Iron ore	$89.20	−0.1%	MMi seaborne 61% Fe, $/dmt
M	Bitcoin	$60,139	+0.7%	
